$\mu(\eta)=(1_20_12_00_12_01_21_02_10_21_0)$, where edge colors appear as subindices of their preceding vertex colors, while $F$ has only green (color 3) edges.
There are two $\beta$-edges for $\mu$, marked with the Greek letter $\beta$. 

