Rejected after full-paper review and implementation testing.

- G and V passed for the inverse-generated equitable total-coloring prototype.
- Track A failed G6: exact equitable DSATUR/DPLL found a verified shipping-size witness in 619,838 nodes (32.129 s), with additional successes under alternative mixing parameters.
- Track B was unsuitable: the hidden plant provides no solver-visible compact route, while the paper’s constructive Kempe, covering-map, and prism methods have essentially identical mechanical and compact costs.
- Oracle hardening was correctly not run after the mandatory local gate failure.

